RecordFlux specifications (specs/)
----------------------------------

The RecordFlux message specifications in specs/ are taken from AdaCore's
RecordFlux project, https://github.com/AdaCore/RecordFlux, directory
examples/specs/ at tag v0.26.0 (commit
857ac277e2c41a28f86efc23c0c5c47f2f3dce56), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in
LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt. The upstream project has no NOTICE file and the
specification files carry no per-file notices.

Unless listed in specs/CHANGES_FROM_UPSTREAM.md, each specification is
byte-identical to upstream (SHA-256 sums are recorded there). Modified
files state their modification in a header comment and in that list, as
the Apache License requires (section 4(b)).

